      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "questName": "Archive Exposure",
      "questDescription": "<b>Mara Kent:</b> Our published angles keep appearing in a rival's feed. We have no evidence of a breach, so first check whether an older public copy could explain the timing. Then recommend a proportionate response to any exposed draft you find.",
      "questCompleteText": "<b>Mara Kent:</b> A GoalPost draft appeared in a dated archive snapshot. That confirms the archive captured the page; it does not show who viewed it or explain how it reached the rival. Recommend that the authorized owner request removal and review publication controls.",
